// What the admin UI follows live, as bus topics streamed to it by the api's
// hub (main.hl, a `ws::Hub` on a port of the api process's own, under the
// operator token): the fleet's heartbeats as they arrive at this instance,
// and the admin plane's events as any instance records them. The store
// keeps the heartbeats' latest (node_state, seat_state, api_instance),
// which the brain reads and a UI's first look reads, and every event's row,
// which the hub's feed follows.
//
// The hub shares the api's process but not yet its port: a hub mounts only
// on an `http::Rest` of the main locus, and the api's is held by `Front`
// (front.hl), until a held one can mount it (hale-lang/hale#1818);
// `GET /admin/v1/hub` tells a UI where it is.

/// A node as it now is, after a report it made was recorded: the whole
/// node as `GET /admin/v1/nodes/{id}` answers it (its capabilities, its
/// hardware among them, and its seats, a managed seat's fetch among them),
/// as JSON, since the bus carries no list of records within a record.
type NodeObservation {
    node: String = "";
    // `register`, `heartbeat`, `seats`, `capabilities` or `local`
    report: String = "";
    at: Time = `1970-01-01T00:00:00Z`;
    body: String = "";
}

topic NodeObserved { payload: NodeObservation; }

/// An api instance's heartbeat: it is alive at `at`.
type InstanceReport { instance: String = ""; at: Time = `1970-01-01T00:00:00Z`; }

topic InstanceBeat { payload: InstanceReport; }

/// One of the admin plane's events (admin_events.hl), as the hub tells it:
/// its id and time as the event stream's, and its `data` as JSON text.
/// Every instance's hub follows the store's rows (`AdminFeed`), so each
/// tells what any instance recorded. A `data` past what one bus frame
/// carries is sent as `null`, `whole` false, and read whole instead.
type AdminRecord {
    id: String = "";
    at: Time = `1970-01-01T00:00:00Z`;
    data: String = "null";
    whole: Bool = true;
}

/// A request settled: its usage record.
topic UsageRecorded { payload: AdminRecord; }
/// A configuration change applied.
topic ChangeMade { payload: AdminRecord; }
/// A request's annotation kept.
topic AnnotationKept { payload: AdminRecord; }
/// A node registered, lost, drained or revoked: the node as it now is.
topic NodeMoved { payload: AdminRecord; }
/// The requests seats are serving now, whole, each time the set changes.
topic RequestsInFlight { payload: AdminRecord; }
